1.png", "id": "1001252065566718", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307352_1001252068900051_1592046074941075571_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S-kZrFzPtT8Q7kNvwGBYoOI&_nc_oc=AdoM4ogJuddsTb818ge3zRsLD4lnFs9BQiZX0vqJCDhNsx79qDytsnFIdkqhaRWqPv0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBSYJWao5E1wsv5pyiTmYn9fWOwRpYIU0xuS7VxQ5lALA&oe=6A6F3F81"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "1670731170913068", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312454_1670731174246401_6604719355597145101_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eLRKS0ucJmAQ7kNvwGTqQkv&_nc_oc=AdqRh8gLKSO-ulNf_wbJqlq9tO5EE9n96qMjVyD_0xRe6jG58gkJgp8aaVO73AacWo0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAnpk3QbdoeOcEjeo4ZjjbPfhgBn-b9MKLOkpP2kZWsxg&oe=6A6F2BAF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Fruit Ninja VR: Ghostbusters", "keywords": ["Fruitninja", "fruitslicinggame", "ninjafruitgame", "fruitcuttinggame", "arcadeslicinggame"], "long_description": "Fruit Ninja VR: Ghostbusters is a fast-paced virtual reality arcade action game that blends classic fruit-slicing gameplay with supernatural ghost-hunting combat. Step into a neon-infused haunted world where you become a ninja exorcist armed with proton-powered blades and responsive VR motion controls designed for immersive gameplay.\n\nYour objective is to slice flying fruit with precision, build combo streaks, and survive waves of paranormal enemies that invade eerie environments. Every level challenges your reflexes, timing, and accuracy as you dodge cursed objects, explosive traps, and aggressive ghost attacks.\n\nFeatures:\n\u2022 Immersive VR motion slicing gameplay \ud83c\udfae for full immersion\n\u2022 Fruit slicing arcade action \ud83c\udf49 with fast-paced challenges\n\u2022 Ghost battles \ud83d\udc7b in haunted arenas\n\u2022 Combo system \u2694\ufe0f for high score combos\n\u2022 Boss fights \ud83d\udc79 with unique attack patterns\n\u2022 Co-op mode \ud83e\udd1d multiplayer support\n\u2022 Survival mode \ud83d\udd25 endless waves challenge\n\u2022 Haunted environments \ud83c\udfda\ufe0f dynamic spooky visuals\n\u2022 Responsive controls \ud83d\udd79\ufe0f smooth VR tracking\n\nProgress through increasingly difficult missions while unlocking new challenges and refining your slicing skills. Compete for high scores, improve your accuracy, and master combo chains to dominate leaderboards. Each session delivers replayable arcade intensity with unpredictable enemy waves and evolving difficulty. Experience action-packed VR combat where speed, precision, and strategy decide your survival in a chaotic supernatural world.", "short_description": "\ud83c\udf49\ud83d\udc7b Fruit Ninja VR: Ghostbusters combines thrilling fruit-slicing action with exciting ghost-hunting adventures in virtual reality! Use precise motion controls to cut flying fruit, defeat spooky ghosts, and test your reflexes in fast-paced arcade challenges. Master your ninja skills, achieve high scores, and enjoy immersive VR gameplay packed with action, excitement, and endless slicing fun! \u2694\ufe0f\ud83c\udf4d\ud83d\udc7b"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/fun-soft/privacy-policy-meta-quest", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Fun Soft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/fun-soft/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_langua